# Anything produced by a build on a developer's machine. Copying these into the
# image at best wastes layers, and at worst ships a stale binary that quietly
# shadows the one the image just compiled.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/out/

.git/
.gitignore
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/

**/appsettings.Development.json
**/*.user
**/.env
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal

docker/
docs/
README.md
